; MBMM Baseline: DDR5-4800 (2400 MHz Clock)
ConfigName DDR5_4800_baseline
CLK 2400

; --- NVMain System Modules (REQUIRED) ---
MEM_CTL FRFCFS
Decoder DRCDecoder
AddressMappingScheme R:BK:C
EventDrv NVMain

; --- Architecture (x8 DIMM) ---
BusWidth 64
DeviceWidth 8
BurstLength 16
RANKS 1
BANKS 32
ROWS 65536
COLS 1024

; --- Timings (14ns @ 2400MHz = ~34 cycles) ---
tCAS 34
tRCD 34
tRP 34
tRAS 77
tRC 111
tWR 36
tRTP 43
tCVD 22
tBURST 8
tCCD 2

; --- Power Model (DRAM Current-Based) ---
EnergyModel current
Voltage 1.1
UseRefresh true
RefreshRows 4096
tRFC 840
tREFI 18720
